Hard was also defeated (2/3 solved), and the first automatic escalation to degree 41 has been solved on its first attempt. This is pointing toward a genuine H failure for the direct two-point formulation; I’ll let the mandated escalation budget finish before deciding, as required.
diff --git a/gen_1803_04931.py b/gen_1803_04931.py
