Even the degree-127 escalation has been solved on its first attempt. The harness still completes all three calls at a rung, so I’m waiting for its formal verdict; if it reports `too_easy` (rather than a budget/cap park), the instructions require retaining the module as `rejected_gen_1803_04931.py` and documenting the measured Track B failure.
